 "words_heard": 269,
 "words": 270,
 "lines": [
  {
   "text": "I am under obligation to the wise",
   "heard": 7,
   "words": 7,
   "error_s": 0.64,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "And to the foolish, both without disguise",
   "heard": 7,
   "words": 7,
   "error_s": 0.65,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "I am eager to preach the good news to you",
   "heard": 10,
   "words": 10,
   "error_s": 0.34,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "Who dwell in the city of Rome, this is true",
   "heard": 10,
   "words": 10,
   "error_s": 0.79,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "I am not ashamed of the gospel I hold",
   "heard": 9,
   "words": 9,
   "error_s": 0.29,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "It is the power of God, a story of old",
   "heard": 9,
   "words": 10,
   "error_s": 1.79,
   "tie_split": true,
   "uncertain": true
  },
  {
   "text": "For in the gospel the righteousness of God is revealed",
   "heard": 10,
   "words": 10,
   "error_s": 0.62,
   "tie_split": true,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "From faith to faith, as the ancient text sealed",
   "heard": 9,
   "words": 9,
   "error_s": 0.31,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "The righteous will live by faith, so the soul may be free",
   "heard": 12,
   "words": 12,
   "error_s": 0.69,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "The righteous will live by faith, eternally",
   "heard": 7,
   "words": 7,
   "error_s": 0.45,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "For the wrath of God is revealed from on high",
   "heard": 10,
   "words": 10,
   "error_s": 0.85,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "Against the ungodliness, the wickedness of the lie",
   "heard": 8,
   "words": 8,
   "error_s": 1.04,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "People suppress the truth with their wickedness and sin",
   "heard": 9,
   "words": 9,
   "error_s": 0.39,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "But what can be known about God is plain within",
   "heard": 10,
   "words": 10,
   "error_s": 0.45,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "He has made it plain to them, clear to see",
   "heard": 10,
   "words": 10,
   "error_s": 0.5,
   "tie_split": true,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "The invisible qualities, the eternal decree",
   "heard": 6,
   "words": 6,
   "error_s": 0.8,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "For in the gospel the righteousness of God is revealed",
   "heard": 10,
   "words": 10,
   "error_s": 0.29,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "From faith to faith, as the ancient text sealed",
   "heard": 9,
   "words": 9,
   "error_s": 0.28,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "The righteous will live by faith, so the soul may be free",
   "heard": 12,
   "words": 12,
   "error_s": 0.26,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "The righteous will live by faith, eternally",
   "heard": 7,
   "words": 7,
   "error_s": 0.49,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "Since the creation of the world, they have been seen",
   "heard": 10,
   "words": 10,
   "error_s": 0.33,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "Understood from what he has made, in between",
   "heard": 8,
   "words": 8,
   "error_s": 0.34,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "His eternal power and divine nature stand",
   "heard": 7,
   "words": 7,
   "error_s": 0.23,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "So they are without excuse in this promised land",
   "heard": 9,
   "words": 9,
   "error_s": 0.18,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "For in the gospel the righteousness of God is revealed",
   "heard": 10,
   "words": 10,
   "error_s": 0.3,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "From faith to faith, as the ancient text sealed",
   "heard": 9,
   "words": 9,
   "error_s": 0.52,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": true
  },
  {
   "text": "The righteous will live by faith, so the soul may be free",
   "heard": 12,
   "words": 12,
   "error_s": 0.61,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "The righteous will live by faith, eternally",
   "heard": 7,
   "words": 7,
   "error_s": 0.44,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
